==Description==
The '''Verdant Nametag''' is a nametag that can be obtained at Level 26 of the premium [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|860}} or {{Robux|82}} ({{Robux|69}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|10,670}} or {{Robux|1,982}} ({{Robux|1,672}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''Verdant Nametag''' has green text with a dark green outline. Behind the text, there are multiple green leaves with small pink flowers, some of which are falling off the nametag.

